{"id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-functor.md","title":"Definition — Functor","display":"Definition — Functor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-functor","aliases":["14-df-functor"],"display":"Definition — Functor","depends_on":["[[14-df-category]]","[[14-df-morphism]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-functor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Functor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c5452002ba29fda\" href=\"?note=5c5452002ba29fda\" title=\"14-df-morphism\">14-df-morphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C),\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal D)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C),\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal D)\\)</span> (categories, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ob},\\mathrm{Mor},\\mathrm{dom},\\mathrm{cod},\\mathrm{id}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ob},\\mathrm{Mor},\\mathrm{dom},\\mathrm{cod},\\mathrm{id}\\)</span> (category operations, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal D}\">\\(\\circ_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal D}\\)</span> (composition operations, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(F_0,F_1)\">\\(F=(F_0,F_1)\\)</span> (object and morphism maps)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsFunctor}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsFunctor}\\)</span> (functor predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>有类型的记号约定：对对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(A)=F_0(A)\">\\(F(A)=F_0(A)\\)</span>，对箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(f)=F_1(f)\">\\(F(f)=F_1(f)\\)</span>；这个约定也用于其他函子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\\Bigl(F_0:\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\land F_1:\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;(\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal D}(F_1(f))=F_0(\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\land\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal D}(F_1(f))=F_0(\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(f)))\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;(F_1(\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathcal C}(A))=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathcal D}(F_0(A)))\\land\\forall f,g\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;(\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(g)=\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(f)\\to F_1(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f)=F_1(g)\\circ_{\\mathcal D}F_1(f))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\\Bigl(F_0:\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\land F_1:\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;(\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal D}(F_1(f))=F_0(\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\land\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal D}(F_1(f))=F_0(\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(f)))\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;(F_1(\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathcal C}(A))=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathcal D}(F_0(A)))\\land\\forall f,g\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;(\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(g)=\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(f)\\to F_1(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f)=F_1(g)\\circ_{\\mathcal D}F_1(f))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：Categorical Preliminaries。</p>\n<p>对象映射和箭头映射分别保持类型、恒等和复合。以下均采用有类型的缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(A)=F_0(A)\">\\(F(A)=F_0(A)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(f)=F_1(f)\">\\(F(f)=F_1(f)\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"5c5452002ba29fda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C),\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal D)$ (categories, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ob},\\mathrm{Mor},\\mathrm{dom},\\mathrm{cod},\\mathrm{id}$ (category operations, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\circ_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal D}$ (composition operations, see [[14-df-category]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C),\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ob},\\mathrm{Mor},\\mathrm{dom},\\mathrm{cod},\\mathrm{id}","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ_{\\mathcal C},\\circ_{\\mathcal D}","display":false},{"tex":"F=(F_0,F_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsFunctor}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"F(A)=F_0(A)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"F(f)=F_1(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\leftrightarrow\\Bigl(F_0:\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\land F_1:\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;(\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal D}(F_1(f))=F_0(\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(f))\\land\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal D}(F_1(f))=F_0(\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(f)))\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;(F_1(\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathcal C}(A))=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathcal D}(F_0(A)))\\land\\forall f,g\\in\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\;(\\mathrm{dom}_{\\mathcal C}(g)=\\mathrm{cod}_{\\mathcal C}(f)\\to F_1(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f)=F_1(g)\\circ_{\\mathcal D}F_1(f))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"F(A)=F_0(A)","display":false},{"tex":"F(f)=F_1(f)","display":false}],"bytes":1773,"backlinks":[{"id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$、$G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C$ 为 [[14-df-functor]] 的函子。$\\eta,\\varepsilon$ 是候选自然变换；自然性与分量见 [[14-df-natural-transformation]]，恒等函子和函子复合见 [[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]。$\\mathrm{IsAdjunctionData}$ 检验指定单位和余单位，$\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}$ 忘掉这两项选择；两者的环境均是固定的 $(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)$。"},{"id":"269866ac001274e3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-functor|Definition — Functor]]"},{"id":"c502117a84587a7c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"74836596676a64ea","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e44fc7caab44c542","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小范畴，$A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 为协变函子。$\\int_{\\mathcal C}A$ 为下列六元组，$\\pi_A$ 为下列投影函子；集合映射和箭头作用采用 [[14-df-functor]] 的有类型缩写。"},{"id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsFunctor}$ (functor predicate, see [[14-df-functor]])"},{"id":"4875436f4c986c7f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"230c16dff32f677b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d70b287bd93237ef","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-functor]]"},{"id":"1601eff2507fda14","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsFunctor}$ (functor predicate, see [[14-df-functor]])"},{"id":"2e748a8b3caef6a6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dad26c5de724390a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F:\\mathcal A\\to\\mathcal B$、$G:\\mathcal B\\to\\mathcal C$ 为函子（[[14-df-functor]]）。函数的复合按右先左后；同一 $\\circ$ 在类型明确时也表示函子复合。"},{"id":"35b4e1443f7ccdbf","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E),\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(K,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)$ (functors, see [[14-df-functor]])"},{"id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal C)$ (diagram, see [[14-df-functor]])"},{"id":"afcd93ebfca63623","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61a5bbf642ba9c20","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"552e996c15863488","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F,G:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ 为函子（[[14-df-functor]]）。候选自然变换 $\\eta$ 为带来源/目标的三元组 $(F,G,\\alpha)$；当该三元组成立时，$\\eta_A$ 表示第三分量 $\\alpha(A)$。范畴及 Hom 见 [[14-df-morphism]]。"},{"id":"300365f146cacc8a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"decc9a8183e886fb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-functor]]"},{"id":"0f4ff76187675015","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in\\mathcal U$，$\\tau\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)$；$F=(F_0,F_1)$ 为候选函子，写 $F(U)=F_0(U)$。$\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)$ 的箭头 $(U,V)$ 在 $V\\subseteq U$ 时从 $U$ 到 $V$。$\\rho^U_{F,V}$ 是下式定义的底层限制函数，$F$ 固定时写作 $\\rho^U_V$；对应的集合范畴箭头是 $(F(U),F(V),\\rho^U_V)$。该记号只在 $F$ 是所指定的函子且 $U,V\\in\\tau$、$V\\subseteq U$ 时使用。集合范畴、函子见 [[14-df-category]]、[[14-df-functor]]。"},{"id":"c4f43915f20a1466","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定本书的宇宙 $\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$。候选空间 $T=(X,\\tau)$、$S=(Y,\\sigma)$ 属于 $\\mathcal U$。函数均保留源靶空间标签，范畴六元组与函子二元组沿用 [[14-df-category]]、[[14-df-functor]]；框架与 locale 范畴见 [[14-df-frame]]、[[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]]、[[14-thm-frame-locale-duality]]。$g\\circ f$ 在集合函数层解释，$f^{-1}[B]=\\{x\\in X\\mid f(x)\\in B\\}$。下式中的 $X_T,\\tau_T$ 表示空间 $T$ 的两个投影。$\\operatorname{LocTop}$、$\\operatorname{Loc}_0$ 的输入限于满足 $\\operatorname{IsTopSpace}(T)$ 的空间，$\\operatorname{Loc}_1$ 的输入限于 $\\mathsf T_1$ 中的带标签连续箭头；开集框架中的偏序是明确限制在 $\\tau_T^2$ 上的关系集合。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-functor|Definition — Functor]]"},{"id":"4f584a450845e8d6","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为 [[14-df-category]] 的范畴；$\\mathrm{IsElementaryTopos}$ 见 [[14-df-elementary-topos]]。$K,D$ 在 Assertion 中量化，小性、函子和余极限谓词分别见 [[14-df-small-category]]、[[14-df-functor]]、[[14-df-limits-colimits]]；$\\mathbb N=\\omega$。"},{"id":"2529efea1cd2e435","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}$、$\\mathrm{IsFunctor}$、$\\mathrm{IsNatural}$、$\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}$、$\\mathrm{IsLeftExact}$ 依次使用[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]、[[14-df-functor]]、[[14-df-natural-transformation]]、[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]、[[14-df-flat-set-functor]]的已列定义；其结构参数由上述 $\\mathcal E,\\mathcal H,i,a_j,\\eta$ 固定。$\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal H}(a_j(A))$ 采用 [[14-df-subobjects]] 的单态射同构类集合。"},{"id":"e937528586d5f172","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,J,\\mathcal D)$ (diagram, see [[14-df-functor]])"},{"id":"8a95d86314c18fd6","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,K,\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J))$ (diagram, see [[14-df-functor]])"},{"id":"0db90275ed4c618a","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsFunctor}$ (functor predicate, see [[14-df-functor]])"}],"outgoing":["28211adc1b0ce5bc","5c5452002ba29fda"]}